From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:56:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 148/151] Find: In selection scopes Count, Replace all and
 highlights, as in Notepad++

Find next, Find previous and Replace work on the whole text even with
"In selection" on, as in Notepad++; the match they select leaves the
range as it is, and a single Replace moves the range with its edit.
Opening the find bar ticks "In selection" only for a selection of at
least 1024 characters (Notepad++'s _inSelectionAutocheckThreshold), no
longer for any selection over lines.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

